  "slug": "bar-service-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Bar Service Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Document a beverage-service incident as observed facts, preserve necessary records, route immediate decisions, and close corrective follow-up.",
  "description": "An original incident report for service refusal, identification concern, guest behavior, injury or illness concern, spill, breakage, property issue, payment dispute, product custody issue, or operating-plan failure. It keeps observations separate from conclusions and protects sensitive decisions.",
  "use_case": "Use after immediate needs are addressed when a material bar-service event requires a traceable record. Limit personal details to what operations need, link source evidence rather than copying sensitive data, and close only after responsible review and corrective-action handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
