            "Affected service point paused or adjusted when needed",
            "Guest moved from the operating area when appropriate",
            "Spill, broken item, or access concern contained",
            "Product, cash, or device custody protected",
            "Relevant order, transaction, or station records preserved",
            "Next update owner and time assigned"
          ]
        },
